store_slot=f'<a class="store-slot" href="{esc(store)}" rel="noopener">View on the App Store {arrow()}</a>'if store else'<p class="store-slot"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>App Store release coming soon.</p>'
badge_art='<img src="assets/download-on-the-app-store.svg" alt="Download on the App Store" width="120" height="40">'
store_badge=('<div class="app-store-placement"><a class="app-store-badge" href="'+esc(store)+'" aria-label="Download GØ-404 on the App Store">'+badge_art+'</a></div>') if store else ('<div class="app-store-placement"><button type="button" class="app-store-badge" disabled aria-label="App Store release coming soon">'+badge_art+'</button><p class="app-store-status">Coming soon to the App Store.</p></div>')
home='''<main id="main"><section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-intro"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="little-line"></span>SAMPLER. SEQUENCER. PERFORMANCE.</p><h1 id="hero-title">MAKE BEATS.<br><span>ANYWHERE.</span></h1></div><div class="hero-details"><p class="hero-subtitle">YOUR POCKET BEAT MACHINE.</p><p class="hero-description">A hands-on sampler, sequencer and performance machine. Built for beats. Designed for your pocket.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-orange" href="#inside">EXPLORE THE MACHINE <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>'''+store_slot+'''</div><div class="hero-footnote"><span>GØ-404 CLASSIC</span><span>FOR IPHONE &amp; IPAD</span></div></div></div><figure class="hero-product" id="devices"><div class="device-pair"><div class="device-ipad"><img src="assets/machine-ipad-lit-v4.svg?v=device-stage-v3-20261111" decoding="async" width="2300" height="3000" alt="GØ-404 on iPad: the original narrow machine geometry centred with black side margins, four illuminated pads and an empty sequencer."></div><div class="device-phone"><img src="assets/machine-phone-lit-v4.svg?v=device-stage-v3-20261111" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1350" height="2760" alt="GØ-404 on iPhone with four illuminated pads and an empty step sequencer."></div></div>'''+store_badge+'''<figcaption><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>THE INSTRUMENT. IN YOUR HANDS.</figcaption></figure><span class="hero-index" aria-hidden="true">01 / THE MACHINE</span></section>
<div class="spec-strip" aria-label="At a glance"><span>HANDS-ON SAMPLING</span><span>16 / 32 STEP SEQUENCING</span><span>RESAMPLE YOUR PERFORMANCE</span><span>WAV EXPORT</span></div>
<section class="section inside" id="inside" aria-labelledby="inside-title"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">01 — FROM SOUND TO SOMETHING YOURS</p><span class="section-label">THE CREATIVE WORKFLOW</span></div><div class="inside-grid"><div><h2 id="inside-title">SAMPLE.<br>CHOP.<br><span class="orange">CREATE.</span></h2><p class="lede">Find a sound.<br>Make it your own.</p><p>Import a WAV. Record a new idea. Trim, fade and pitch it into place. Let Auto Chop find your starting points, then put your hands on the details.</p><div class="auto-key-feature"><p class="eyebrow">AUTO KEY</p><h3>Stay in Tune</h3><p>GØ-404 analyzes your samples on A9–A16 and automatically tunes the bass and instruments to match. Sample, play and create.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="support/#sampling">Start sampling <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="workflow-view"><div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Explore the workflow"><button role="tab" id="tab-sampling" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="panel-sampling">SAMPLING</button><button role="tab" id="tab-sequencing" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-sequencing" tabindex="-1">SEQUENCING</button></div><div role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" id="panel-sampling" aria-labelledby="tab-sampling"><figure class="wave-display"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/waveform.jpg" width="900" height="322" alt="Real GØ-404 waveform editor with a selected range and precise trim and fade markers."><figcaption><span>TRIM / FADE</span><span>YOUR SOUND. YOUR CUT.</span></figcaption></figure><div class="workflow-steps"><span><b>01</b> LOAD A SOUND</span><span><b>02</b> FIND YOUR CUT</span><span><b>03</b> PLAY THE PADS</span></div><p class="detail-copy">Drum hits or musical phrases. Auto Chop keeps those workflows distinct, with manual editing when you want the final say.</p><button class="text-link image-open" data-image="assets/pad-edit-vintage-model-lamps-20261110.png?v=stereo-compact-v3" data-alt="GØ-404 PAD EDIT, showing a real waveform, hardware-style knobs and Vintage control.">See PAD EDIT <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><div role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" id="panel-sequencing" aria-labelledby="tab-sequencing" hidden><figure class="sequence-display"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/sequencer.jpg" width="936" height="460" alt="Actual GØ-404 pad and step-sequencer controls, including patterns P1 to P4."><figcaption><span>BUILD YOUR GROOVE.</span><span>16 / 32 STEPS</span></figcaption></figure><div class="workflow-steps"><span><b>01</b> PLAY A PATTERN</span><span><b>02</b> ADD THE SWING</span><span><b>03</b> BUILD A SONG</span></div><p class="detail-copy">Four patterns, Song Mode, swing and bass pads. Start with a drum kit, find a new variation with DRUMS, and build the rhythm, bass and melody together.</p><a class="text-link" href="support/#sequencing">Explore patterns <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div><!-- verified-feature-guide-20261109 --><div class="workflow-features" aria-label="More ways to build your beat">
<article><p class="eyebrow">TIME STRETCH</p><h3>Make the sound fit.</h3><p>Change a sample’s length without changing its pitch. Use the waveform handle or FIT TO BPM, on one pad or the current group of eight.</p><a class="text-link" href="support/#time-stretch">Time Stretch guide ↗</a></article>
<article><p class="eyebrow">SIDECHAIN</p><h3>Give the drums space.</h3><p>Let a chosen bank A pad duck your samples, bass or instruments. Shape the amount and release, per pad or for the group.</p><a class="text-link" href="support/#sidechain">Sidechain guide ↗</a></article>
<article><p class="eyebrow">BANK B / BASS &amp; INSTRUMENT</p><h3>Play the bass. Find a melody.</h3><p>Two playable voices across bank B. Choose a sound, shape it in SOUND and FX, and build notes into your beat.</p><a class="text-link" href="support/#bank-b">Explore bank B ↗</a></article>
<article><p class="eyebrow">MIDI LEARN</p><h3>Put your controller to work.</h3><p>Connect by USB-C or a Lightning USB host adapter. Map supported pads, buttons and knobs, then keep your controller setup for the next session.</p><a class="text-link" href="support/#midi">Connect &amp; learn ↗</a></article>
</div></section>
<section class="vintage section" id="vintage" aria-labelledby="vintage-title"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">02 — VINTAGE SOUND ENGINES</p><span class="section-label">TEXTURE, BY CHOICE.</span></div><div class="vintage-intro"><h2 id="vintage-title">THREE CHARACTERS.<br><span class="silver">ONE MACHINE.</span></h2><p>Three distinct vintage-inspired sampling characters. Bring classic digital texture and character to your sound.</p></div><div class="model-bank" role="tablist" aria-label="Vintage sampling character"><button class="model-key" role="tab" id="model-1200" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="character-1200"><span class="model-led" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="model-number">1200</span><span class="model-tag">RAW TEXTURE</span></button><button class="model-key" role="tab" id="model-60" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="character-60" tabindex="-1"><span class="model-led" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="model-number">60</span><span class="model-tag">WARM CHARACTER</span></button><button class="model-key" role="tab" id="model-3000" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="character-3000" tabindex="-1"><span class="model-led" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="model-number">3000</span><span class="model-tag">FOCUSED DETAIL</span></button></div><div class="character-info"><div role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" id="character-1200" aria-labelledby="model-1200"><span class="character-index">CHARACTER / 01</span><h3>A little rough around the edges.</h3><p>A grainier digital texture for drums, chopped phrases and sounds that want a little less polish.</p></div><div role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" id="character-60" aria-labelledby="model-60" hidden><span class="character-index">CHARACTER / 02</span><h3>Warmth with a different weight.</h3><p>A distinct vintage-inspired character. A different way to shape the feel of a bass phrase, a chord or a drum hit.</p></div><div role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" id="character-3000" aria-labelledby="model-3000" hidden><span class="character-index">CHARACTER / 03</span><h3>Texture with room for detail.</h3><p>A more focused sampling character for when you want a different finish without giving up the identity of the source.</p></div><p class="character-note">Choose per pad. Keep your original source.<br>Vintage-inspired characters, not claims of identical hardware emulation.</p></div></section>
<section class="section performance" id="performance" aria-labelledby="performance-title"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">03 — TONE &amp; PERFORMANCE FX</p><span class="section-label">TEXTURE. MOVEMENT. CHARACTER.</span></div><h2 id="performance-title">SHAPE YOUR<br><span class="orange">SOUND.</span></h2><div class="sound-fx-grid"><article class="sound-fx-card"><p class="eyebrow">TONE FX</p><h3>Give it character.</h3><p>Vinyl warmth, cassette colour, saturation and gritty texture. Shape the sound before you take it into the next performance.</p><figure><img loading="lazy" src="assets/campaign-tone-fx-sleeve.png" width="1000" height="729" alt="Current GØ-404 TONE FX controls: Vinyl Glue, Cassette, Vinyl Noise, Drive, Lo-Fi, Dirt Glitch and Pitch Mod."><figcaption>TONE FX / THE SOUND OF YOUR MACHINE</figcaption></figure><ul class="effect-list" aria-label="Tone effects"><li>VINYL GLUE</li><li>CASSETTE</li><li>VINYL NOISE</li><li>DRIVE</li><li>LO-FI</li><li>DIRT GLITCH</li><li>PITCH MOD</li></ul></article><article class="sound-fx-card"><p class="eyebrow">PERFORMANCE FX</p><h3>Play the effects.</h3><p>Sweep, filter, echo and loop the beat in real time. Combine LOOPER with MUTE DRUMS. Use HOLD FX to keep an effect engaged while your hands make the next move.</p><figure><img loading="lazy" src="assets/campaign-performance-fx-sleeve.png" width="1000" height="729" alt="Current GØ-404 PERFORMANCE FX controls: Super Filter, Isolator, Tape Echo, Pitch All, Looper, Vinyl Stop and Mute Drums."><figcaption>PERFORMANCE FX / KEEP THE MOMENT</figcaption></figure><ul class="effect-list" aria-label="Performance effects"><li>SUPER FILTER</li><li>ISOLATOR</li><li>TAPE ECHO</li><li>PITCH ALL</li><li>LOOPER</li><li>MUTE DRUMS</li><li>VINYL STOP</li></ul><p class="tone-note"><span>HOLD FX</span> Keep an effect engaged.</p></article></div><div class="sound-resample"><div class="resample-story"><p class="eyebrow">FLIP IT. RESAMPLE IT.</p><h3>The performance<br>becomes the sample.</h3><p>Resample a pattern, a song or a live pass with performance FX. Reuse the result, or open PAD EDIT → RESAMPLE to print one processed sound into another pad while keeping the source. <a href="support/#pad-resample">See both resampling workflows ↗</a></p><figure><img loading="lazy" src="assets/resample-waveform.jpg" width="900" height="322" alt="Actual waveform selection from the GØ-404 PAD RESAMPLE interface."><figcaption>PAD RESAMPLE / A NEW SOUND. A NEW PAD.</figcaption><div class="resample-steps" aria-label="Pad resampling workflow"><span>ORIGINAL PAD</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>RESAMPLE</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>NEW PAD</span></div></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="section capture" id="capture" aria-labelledby="capture-title"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">04 — GO BEYOND THE PATTERN</p><span class="section-label">PERFORM. CAPTURE. REUSE.</span></div><div class="capture-grid"><article class="turntable-story"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span>GØ TURNTABLE</p><h2 id="capture-title">SCRATCH<br><span class="silver">YOUR SOUND.</span></h2><p><strong>FREE TO SCRATCH. PRO TO GO FURTHER.</strong></p><p>FREE: 2 scratch slots. PRO: 4 scratch slots + performance recording. Load your own sounds, work the crossfader and cut them over your beat.</p><figure class="turntable-image campaign-sleeve-view"><button class="campaign-image-open image-open" data-image="assets/campaign-turntable-sleeve.png" data-alt="CUT. SCRATCH. REPEAT. — the approved GØ TURNTABLE campaign artwork with the real platter, crossfader and controls."><img loading="lazy" src="assets/campaign-turntable-sleeve.png" width="1206" height="2622" alt="CUT. SCRATCH. REPEAT. — the approved GØ TURNTABLE campaign artwork with the real platter, crossfader and controls."></button><figcaption>GØ TURNTABLE / CUT. SCRATCH. REPEAT.</figcaption></figure></article><article class="capture-tools"><p class="eyebrow">GØ GRAB <span class="pro-label">PRO</span></p><h3 class="grab-headline">SAMPLE FROM<br>OTHER APPS.</h3><p class="grab-generations">OLD IPHONE. NEW IPHONE.<br>SAME FREEDOM.</p><p class="grab-description">Capture audio from supported apps on both older and newer iPhones. Save it, chop it, and flip it into your next beat.</p><figure class="grab-ui campaign-sleeve-view"><button class="campaign-image-open image-open" data-image="assets/campaign-sampling-sleeve.png" data-alt="SAMPLE FROM OTHER APPS. — the approved campaign artwork with real SAMPLER, CRATE and GØ GRAB panels."><img loading="lazy" src="assets/campaign-sampling-sleeve.png" width="1206" height="2622" alt="SAMPLE FROM OTHER APPS. — the approved campaign artwork with real SAMPLER, CRATE and GØ GRAB panels."></button><figcaption>GØ GRAB / REQUIRES A PRO SUBSCRIPTION</figcaption></figure><div class="capture-tool"><div><h4>CRATE</h4><span class="pro-label">PRO</span></div><p>One library for GØ GRAB, USB takes and scratch recordings. Search, preview and trim your audio. Load it into SAMPLER for chopping, or into a TURNTABLE slot for your next cut.</p></div><div class="capture-tool"><div><h4>USB SAMPLING</h4><span class="pro-label">PRO</span></div><p>Connect a compatible USB audio input by USB-C or a Lightning USB host adapter. Check the input, press REC, then STOP → CRATE. Keep the take in your sample library and use it in your next beat.</p></div><p class="small-print">Capture only audio you own or have permission to use. Protected content and source apps may restrict recording. USB audio compatibility varies; USB audio is not MIDI.</p><a class="text-link" href="support/#usb">Capture &amp; USB help <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article></div></section>
<section class="section ownership" id="free-pro" aria-labelledby="ownership-title"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">05 — A MACHINE THAT IS YOURS</p><span class="section-label">START WITH THE GROOVE.</span></div><div class="ownership-intro"><h2 id="ownership-title">YOUR BEAT.<br><span class="orange">YOUR MACHINE.</span></h2><p>The core beatmaking workflow stays free. PRO adds capture, organization and more ways to take your work further.</p></div><div class="comparison"><article><div class="tier-heading"><h3>FREE</h3><span>THE CORE INSTRUMENT</span></div><ul><li>Unlimited local projects</li><li>Sampling &amp; Auto Chop</li><li>16 / 32-step sequencer &amp; Song Mode</li><li>Core effects &amp; resampling</li><li>TURNTABLE: 2 scratch slots</li><li>Time Stretch &amp; MIDI Learn</li><li>Bass &amp; instrument voices</li><li>WAV export</li><li>Included drum kits &amp; free faceplates</li></ul></article><article><div class="tier-heading"><h3>PRO</h3><span>MORE WAYS TO CREATE</span></div><ul><li>GØ GRAB</li><li>CRATE &amp; USB Sampling</li><li>TURNTABLE: 4 scratch slots + performance recording</li><li>Stem export</li><li>GØ BACKUP to your private iCloud</li><li>GØ TAPES drum pack</li><li>Selected additional faceplates</li></ul><p class="small-print">PRO includes all 4 TURNTABLE slots and performance recording. Subscription plans and localized prices are shown by Apple in the app.</p></article></div><div class="make-yours"><div class="make-yours-copy"><p class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS.</p><h3>Your sound.<br>Your front panel.</h3><p>Start with the included GØ DUST kit. Add GØ STREETS or bring your own samples. Choose a faceplate that feels like your machine.</p><p class="small-print">The catalog also contains separately purchased drum and faceplate packs. Store availability will be confirmed at release.</p></div><div class="faceplate-gallery" aria-label="Actual GØ-404 machines with three faceplate designs"><figure><button class="image-open faceplate-preview" data-image="assets/faceplate-machine-orange-dust.png?v=real-machine-final" aria-label="Enlarge Orange Dust machine"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/faceplate-machine-orange-dust.png?v=real-machine-final" width="780" height="1688" alt="Actual GØ-404 machine with the Orange Dust faceplate and programmed sequencer."></button><figcaption>ORANGE DUST <span>FREE DESIGN</span></figcaption></figure><figure><button class="image-open faceplate-preview" data-image="assets/faceplate-machine-raw-metal.png?v=real-machine-final" aria-label="Enlarge Raw Metal machine"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/faceplate-machine-raw-metal.png?v=real-machine-final" width="780" height="1688" alt="Actual GØ-404 machine with the Raw Metal faceplate and programmed sequencer."></button><figcaption>RAW METAL <span>FREE DESIGN</span></figcaption></figure><figure><button class="image-open faceplate-preview" data-image="assets/faceplate-machine-soul-console.png?v=real-machine-final" aria-label="Enlarge Soul Console machine"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/faceplate-machine-soul-console.png?v=real-machine-final" width="780" height="1688" alt="Actual GØ-404 machine with the Soul Console faceplate and programmed sequencer."></button><figcaption>SOUL CONSOLE <span>PRO DESIGN</span></figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="closing-line"><p>YOUR NEXT BEAT<br>DOESN’T NEED TO WAIT.</p><a class="button button-light" href="support/">GET TO KNOW GØ-404 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section></main>'''
